export default {"id":"note-level-15","number":15,"title":"A Move Peer","skillBand":"Textbook","duration":"From the course textbook","summary":"a.1","modules":[{"id":"note-m-1-101","code":"1","title":"a.1","blurb":"a.1","outcomes":[],"sources":[],"practiceFocus":[],"checkpoints":[],"lessons":[{"id":"note-l-a-1","title":"A.1 — Cloud shares Sets among Note, Move, Live, Push","blocks":[{"type":"step","title":"A.1 — Cloud shares Sets among Note, Move, Live, Push","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"<em>APPENDIX A · Move as Cloud peer (optional)</em>"}]},{"type":"step","title":"Objective","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Enable Cloud on Note and state who can see the same eight Sets: Note, Move, Live, and Push."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Instruction","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Manual §2.1 / §10.1: Ableton Cloud stores up to <strong>eight</strong> Sets from Note and Move; they appear across Ableton products logged into the same account. Setting Up Ableton Cloud KB: upload Note and Move Sets to Live and sync iOS devices. Push 3 standalone can open those Cloud Sets (Projects on Push KB)."},{"type":"prose","html":"Using Move with Ableton Cloud: when Cloud is on for Move, previously uploaded <strong>Note</strong> Sets download to Move automatically. Live shows them under <strong>Places → Cloud</strong>. Live compatibility: Note Sets 11.2.5+; Move Sets called out as 11.3+ in that article."},{"type":"prose","html":"Same-account email. Not a collaborator Cloud (FAQ: use Share To). Not simultaneous edit on two devices (Move Cloud KB)."},{"type":"prose","html":"This appendix is optional. You do not need Move hardware to finish Gates A–J."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Procedure","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Note: enable <strong>Ableton Cloud</strong> (Settings, library banner, or Set Options → Upload). Sign in.","Confirm a Set appears under Cloud in the Note library.","On Live (11.2.5+), enable Show Cloud / sign in with the <strong>same</strong> email. Open Places → Cloud.","If you own Move or Push, confirm the same Set is listed there after sync.","Recite: eight Sets, one account, Note / Move / Live / Push — not two-way from Live."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Self-check","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["How many Cloud Sets? <strong>Answer:</strong> Eight.","Can Live send a Set back to Note? <strong>Answer:</strong> No (FAQ / Compatibility).","Simultaneous edit on Move and Note? <strong>Answer:</strong> Not supported (Move Cloud KB)."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Sources","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Ableton Note Manual §2.1, §10.1","Setting Up Ableton Cloud; Ableton Cloud FAQ","Using Move with Ableton Cloud — https://help.ableton.com/hc/en-us/articles/15599285481628","Note FAQ"],"ordered":false}]},{"type":"step","title":"Exercise","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Upload one non-hero Set as a Cloud test. Do not use a Gate J hero until sync is proven."},{"type":"prose","html":"<em>Syllabus ID: <code>note-a1-1</code></em>"}]}],"minutes":8}],"exercises":[]},{"id":"note-m-2-102","code":"2","title":"a.2","blurb":"a.2","outcomes":[],"sources":[],"practiceFocus":[],"checkpoints":[],"lessons":[{"id":"note-l-a-2","title":"A.2 — Note 1.2+ Move sharing","blocks":[{"type":"step","title":"A.2 — Note 1.2+ Move sharing","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"<em>APPENDIX A · Move as Cloud peer (optional)</em>"}]},{"type":"step","title":"Objective","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Version-gate Move sharing: Note <strong>1.2</strong> added it; Note→Move is <strong>up to four tracks</strong>."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Instruction","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Note Release Notes <strong>1.2</strong>: “Sets can be shared with Ableton Move.” Cloud later supports <strong>8</strong> Sets (was 5) in the same notes."},{"type":"prose","html":"How to manage and share Move Sets KB: transfers:"},{"type":"list","items":["Move → Note: yes","Move → Live: yes","<strong>Note → Move: yes, up to four tracks</strong>","Live → Move: no","Live → Note: no"],"ordered":false},{"type":"prose","html":"Using Move with Ableton Cloud: although Note Sets can have eight tracks, <strong>only tracks 1–4</strong> play/edit on Move. Re-order tracks 5–8 into slots 1–4 in Note (Manual §4.1 long-press reorder) if you need them on Move. Samples recorded in Note play in the Set on Move but do <strong>not</strong> appear in Move’s sample browser. Sets &gt; <strong>50 MB</strong> may not upload reliably."},{"type":"prose","html":"Check <strong>Help</strong> for ≥ 1.2."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Procedure","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Confirm Note ≥ 1.2 in Help.","Build or open a Set with ≤ 4 tracks you care about on Move (or reorder).","Upload to Cloud. On Move, open Set Overview and find the Set (Move Cloud KB).","Play tracks 1–4. Confirm 5–8 are absent unless reordered.","Recite: 1.2+ ; four tracks on Move; 50 MB caution."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Self-check","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Which Note version added Move sharing? <strong>Answer:</strong> 1.2.","How many Note tracks can Move play? <strong>Answer:</strong> Tracks 1–4.","Live → Move? <strong>Answer:</strong> No."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Sources","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Note Release Notes 1.2","How to manage and share Move Sets — https://help.ableton.com/hc/en-us/articles/17032431214236","Using Move with Ableton Cloud","Ableton Note Manual §4.1 (reorder)"],"ordered":false}]},{"type":"step","title":"Exercise","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"If you do not own Move, write the four-track rule on your compatibility card and skip the hardware steps."},{"type":"prose","html":"<em>Syllabus ID: <code>note-a1-2</code></em>"}]}],"minutes":8}],"exercises":[]},{"id":"note-m-3-103","code":"3","title":"a.3","blurb":"a.3","outcomes":[],"sources":[],"practiceFocus":[],"checkpoints":[],"lessons":[{"id":"note-l-a-3","title":"A.3 — When to sketch on Note vs perform on Move","blocks":[{"type":"step","title":"A.3 — When to sketch on Note vs perform on Move","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"<em>APPENDIX A · Move as Cloud peer (optional)</em>"}]},{"type":"step","title":"Objective","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Choose Note for Session sketching and Capture; treat Move as a four-track performance peer, not a second Live."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Instruction","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Note Manual §1: playable mobile app for sketching, capturing, sampling, sending. Session grid, 8 tracks, MIDI Editor, 2.x audio tracks, Show Touches — those are Note jobs."},{"type":"prose","html":"Move is hardware (32 pads, encoders — Move Manual overview). Cloud makes it a <strong>peer</strong>, not a clone. Four-track ceiling on Note→Move (Move Sets KB). Note samples do not land in Move’s browser (Move Cloud KB). Link Audio: Move and Note <strong>send</strong> audio, they do not receive (Link Audio FAQ, Note 2.0 / Move 2.0)."},{"type":"prose","html":"Sketch on Note when you need more than four tracks, the MIDI Editor, or iOS sampling. Perform on Move when you want pads/encoders and ≤ 4 tracks already synced. Do not work the same Cloud Set on both at once."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Procedure","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["List your current idea’s track count.","If &gt; 4 tracks you care about, stay on Note (or reorder 5–8 down before Move).","If you need MIDI Editor polish, stay on Note, then Cloud.","If you want a pad performance of a 4-track sketch, Cloud to Move and play.","Recite: Note = sketch/editor; Move = 4-track perform; never both at once."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Self-check","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Why might a 6-track Note Set disappoint on Move? <strong>Answer:</strong> Only tracks 1–4 play.","Can Move receive Link Audio from Note? <strong>Answer:</strong> No. Both send only (Link Audio FAQ).","Simultaneous Cloud edit? <strong>Answer:</strong> Not supported."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Sources","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Ableton Note Manual §1","How to manage and share Move Sets","Using Move with Ableton Cloud","Link Audio FAQ — https://help.ableton.com/hc/en-us/articles/25425913328924"],"ordered":false}]},{"type":"step","title":"Exercise","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Write “Note sketch / Move perform / Live finish” on the compatibility card."},{"type":"prose","html":"<em>Syllabus ID: <code>note-a1-3</code></em>"}]}],"minutes":8}],"exercises":[]},{"id":"note-m-4-104","code":"4","title":"a.4","blurb":"a.4","outcomes":[],"sources":[],"practiceFocus":[],"checkpoints":[],"lessons":[{"id":"note-l-a-4","title":"A.4 — Live version pairing (only what sources state)","blocks":[{"type":"step","title":"A.4 — Live version pairing (only what sources state)","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"<em>APPENDIX A · Move as Cloud peer (optional)</em>"}]},{"type":"step","title":"Objective","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Record the version pairs the KBs actually publish. Do not invent a full compatibility matrix."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Instruction","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Sourced pairs:"},{"type":"list","items":["<strong>Note Sets in Live:</strong> Live <strong>11.2.5 and later</strong>, all editions (Note Compatibility; FAQ).","<strong>Cloud in Live:</strong> 11.2.5+ (FAQ).","<strong>Move Sets from Cloud in Live:</strong> Move Cloud KB says <strong>Live 11.3 or later</strong>.","<strong>Link Audio:</strong> Live <strong>12.4</strong> / Push <strong>2.4</strong> / Move <strong>2.0</strong> / Note <strong>2.0</strong> (Link Audio FAQ; Compatibility).","<strong>Preset export Live → Note/Move:</strong> experimental as of <strong>Live 12.1</strong> (Presets on Move and Note).","Note <strong>1.1.1</strong>: Live “new file format” warning was bad metadata from Note — re-save from updated Note; no Live update required."],"ordered":false},{"type":"prose","html":"{type:'gap'} Sources do not publish a table of every Note x Live x Move build. If a combo is not listed, leave it unmarked — do not guess."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Procedure","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Write your Note version (Help), Live version (About Live), and Move version if any.","Tick each sourced pair you meet (11.2.5, 11.3 for Move Sets, 12.4/2.0 for Link Audio, 12.1 for preset export).","If Live warned about file format, update Note past 1.1.1 and re-save (RN).","Recite only the pairs you ticked.","Leave unticked rows as gaps."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Self-check","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Minimum Live for Note Sets? <strong>Answer:</strong> 11.2.5.","Link Audio versions? <strong>Answer:</strong> Live 12.4, Note 2.0, Move 2.0, Push 2.4.","May you invent “Note 1.7 needs Live 12.2”? <strong>Answer:</strong> No. Not in the extracts."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Sources","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Note Compatibility KB; Note FAQ","Using Move with Ableton Cloud (11.3)","Link Audio FAQ","Presets on Move and Note (12.1)","Note Release Notes 1.1.1"],"ordered":false}]},{"type":"step","title":"Exercise","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Add this pairing card next to the travel kit card."},{"type":"prose","html":"<em>Syllabus ID: <code>note-a1-4</code></em>"}]}],"minutes":8}],"exercises":[]},{"id":"note-m-5-105","code":"5","title":"a.5","blurb":"a.5","outcomes":[],"sources":[],"practiceFocus":[],"checkpoints":[],"lessons":[{"id":"note-l-a-5","title":"A.5 — Presets on Move & Note (special rules)","blocks":[{"type":"step","title":"A.5 — Presets on Move & Note (special rules)","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"<em>APPENDIX A · Move as Cloud peer (optional)</em>"}]},{"type":"step","title":"Objective","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"State the official preset-export rules: experimental Live 12.1 feature, required rack shapes, Note load path."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Instruction","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"Presets on Move and Note KB (https://help.ableton.com/hc/en-us/articles/15616909965596):"},{"type":"list","items":["Factory presets ship with Move and Note.","As of <strong>Live 12.1</strong>, you can <strong>experimentally</strong> export presets from Live. Enable Options.txt: <code>-_Feature.ExportPresetsToAbl</code>.","<strong>Drums</strong> must be Instrument Rack → Drum Rack (Drum Samplers on pads + one return effect) + one insert effect.","<strong>Drift</strong> must be Instrument Rack → macro rack → Drift + two insert effects.","Mapped macros from Live <strong>will not display</strong>.","Supported instruments: Drum Rack (Drum Sampler), Drift, Drum Sampler, Instrument Rack.","Supported effects: Channel EQ, Chorus-Ensemble, Delay, Phaser-Flanger, Redux, Reverb, Saturator.","Drift on Move has lower voice caps than Live (Poly max 8 notes, etc.).","Export: right-click outer Instrument Rack → <strong>Export ABL Preset</strong> → <code>.ablpresetbundle</code>.","<strong>Load in Note:</strong> get the bundle onto iOS, Files → <strong>Open in Ableton Note</strong>.","Move upload max <strong>400 MB</strong>. Templates exist in User Manuals (<code>Move &amp; Note Drift Template.adg</code>, Drum Rack template)."],"ordered":false},{"type":"prose","html":"Using Note Presets in Live is the other direction (save from a Cloud Set into User Library)."}]},{"type":"step","title":"Procedure","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Read the KB. If you will not touch Options.txt, stop after factory presets — that is valid.","If you export: build the <strong>exact</strong> rack shape. Export <code>.ablpresetbundle</code>.","AirDrop or Files the bundle. Open in Note.","If it fails, check instrument/effect support and file size — do not invent a fix.","Recite: experimental 12.1; required structure; Open in Ableton Note."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Self-check","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Is Live→Note preset export a finished shipping workflow? <strong>Answer:</strong> The KB calls it experimental / still in development (12.1).","How do you load the bundle in Note? <strong>Answer:</strong> Open the <code>.ablpresetbundle</code> in Files → Open in Ableton Note.","Will Live macros show on Move/Note? <strong>Answer:</strong> No. Mapped macros are not displayed."],"ordered":true}]},{"type":"step","title":"Sources","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":["Presets on Move and Note KB","Using Note Presets in Live","User Manuals: Move &amp; Note templates (.adg)"],"ordered":false}]},{"type":"step","title":"Exercise","blocks":[{"type":"prose","html":"If you skip the experimental flag, browse factory Note presets only and write “no Live export” on the card."},{"type":"prose","html":"<em>Syllabus ID: <code>note-a1-5</code></em>"}]}],"minutes":8}],"exercises":[]}]};
